mpleVQA 79.16, WorldVQA 58.10, BC-VL 58.96, V* 95.29, HR-Bench 4K 89.13 / 8K 86.34, VisualProbe 65.05, Step-SWE-Bench 67.08 = mean of six harness runs 67.5/67.0/71.5/67.5/64.5/64.5). tau2-bench Telecom stays null: prose gives only the lower-bound phrasing \"passes at over 98%\" with no exact number. No missing benchmark item."
